{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Darkwater is a cooperative extraction horror game for 1-4 players. Take command of your own custom submarine and survive the icy depths of an alien moon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/extras/Fixing___Repairing__Water_.gif?t=1745340971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or enlist your own submariner crew. Up to 4 players can team up and survive an onslaught of deep-sea threats. Face down enemy submarines in naval warfare and dock your vessel to abandoned outposts in order to scavenge for supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/extras/Action_Combat__Water_.gif?t=1745340971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A devastating disease has struck an alien planet. The government has frozen the surface of the ocean in response. You and your crew are trapped below the ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Source fuel and travel from outpost to outpost in a desperate bid for survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover snippets of information relating to a greater truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan and strategize every step of the way as you fight against the relentless adversity of a desperate world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/extras/Exploring__Water_.gif?t=1745340971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources are scarce. Discover and explore dilapidated underwater facilities on foot and strip them for all they\u2019re worth. Be prepared to deal with what lurks below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face down a variety of unpredictable enemies including infected divers, deep-sea angler fish and alien crabs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even the odds using a wide range of weaponry including sledgehammers, blow torches, pistols and shotguns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure you and your team have enough room to carry back the fuel canisters critical to your survival - teamwork is key to ensuring you live to see another day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/extras/Sub_Combat__Water_.gif?t=1745340971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take direct control of onboard systems for piloting, weapons and sonar. Upgrade your submarine. Expand your deck, invest in different cabins, negotiate with rival vessels, but be ready for war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a variety of powerful torpedoes, harpoons, decoy mines and depth charges to gain the upper hand in sub-to-sub combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Board enemy vessels using a manned torpedo to deliver the ultimate in-person surprise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest in unique rooms for your submarine that help with hacking, stealth and other strategic options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/extras/Shop_2__Water_.gif?t=1745340971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"High Roller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/619540/8ad7bfc0cfe7fd285a8a99f94d027dd7e75354e3.jpg"},{"name":"We\u2019re saved!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/619540/1b43341ebdd976177ce8de639782e35e29f0a92d.jpg"},{"name":"Against All Odds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/619540/6d9af898ddc7e2f974e167128d797e8c54ce4e4f.jpg"},{"name":"Special Delivery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/619540/63f2eca95a365930040069f1507c11f4d5fea5f6.jpg"},{"name":"Minimal Liability","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/619540/b3906274312a29543bb2eb2bc9d69b41517ea4c1.jpg"},{"name":"High Score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/619540/863cb03c76fb5acc64bf02a94efc942bf3a3c7db.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/619540?t=1745340971","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/d6e6510423eaa0fd9b6a3cac7d83c53ee5265f64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745340971","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/8bd2b6dfe14fffaeb6054c79799477f694864c4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745340971","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/8bd2b6dfe14fffaeb6054c79799477f694864c4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745340971","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Players will fight divers, automatons, and alien creatures."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/extras/Darkwater_Roadmap_ReleaseCalendar_01e.png?t=1745340971\" /></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Darkwater is a cooperative extraction horror game for 1-4 players. Take command of your own custom submarine and survive the icy depths of an alien moon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/extras/Fixing___Repairing__Water_.gif?t=1745340971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or enlist your own submariner crew. Up to 4 players can team up and survive an onslaught of deep-sea threats. Face down enemy submarines in naval warfare and dock your vessel to abandoned outposts in order to scavenge for supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/extras/Action_Combat__Water_.gif?t=1745340971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A devastating disease has struck an alien planet. The government has frozen the surface of the ocean in response. You and your crew are trapped below the ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Source fuel and travel from outpost to outpost in a desperate bid for survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover snippets of information relating to a greater truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan and strategize every step of the way as you fight against the relentless adversity of a desperate world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/extras/Exploring__Water_.gif?t=1745340971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources are scarce. Discover and explore dilapidated underwater facilities on foot and strip them for all they\u2019re worth. Be prepared to deal with what lurks below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face down a variety of unpredictable enemies including infected divers, deep-sea angler fish and alien crabs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even the odds using a wide range of weaponry including sledgehammers, blow torches, pistols and shotguns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure you and your team have enough room to carry back the fuel canisters critical to your survival - teamwork is key to ensuring you live to see another day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/extras/Sub_Combat__Water_.gif?t=1745340971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take direct control of onboard systems for piloting, weapons and sonar. Upgrade your submarine. Expand your deck, invest in different cabins, negotiate with rival vessels, but be ready for war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a variety of powerful torpedoes, harpoons, decoy mines and depth charges to gain the upper hand in sub-to-sub combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Board enemy vessels using a manned torpedo to deliver the ultimate in-person surprise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest in unique rooms for your submarine that help with hacking, stealth and other strategic options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/extras/Shop_2__Water_.gif?t=1745340971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Targon Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619540/1cfdc7c9670fb4267803d6b26778b0bec120de74/header.jpg?t=1745340971","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025, Playstack and Targon Studios, all rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126399,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126399/movie480.mp4?t=1744737811","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126399/movie_max.mp4?t=1744737811"},"name":"Darkwater - Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126399/dcaf686a50bd0c1fe6514924ed3c8dab7d3b3869/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744737811","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126399/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744737811","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126399/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744737811"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257080530,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080530/movie480.mp4?t=1744737813","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080530/movie_max